--- !u!1001 &1333962201
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 0}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1224224317435694482, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Sprite
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -1870255924, guid: 5a58fd1cd3a5a3141b6b095e3142253a, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[0]
      value: I have been expecting you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[1]
      value: I should begin by welcoming you, thank you for coming to the castle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[2]
      value: As you've likely heard, a thief has been terrorizing everyone by stealing
        their belongings.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[3]
      value: You must put an end to this, and perhaps, after it, you'll be offered
        a position in the royal army.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[4]
      value: Simply go through the teleporter to your right.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2641175210428784259, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.data[5]
      value: I'll escort you myself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2741854173681740130, guid: 2ed84303b3c1c3b44a85ef4e464a50c5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
      value: 51.9
